<title>UK: Lloyds TSB spends 100 mln stg on millennium.</title>
<headline>Lloyds TSB spends 100 mln stg on millennium.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>British bank Lloyds TSB Group said on Friday  it would spend around 100 million stg on adapting its computers for  the problems posed by the millennium.</p>
<p>&quot;It will cost us about 100 million stg to be compliant,&quot; chief executive  Peter Ellwood told reporters at a news conference.</p>
<p>Ellwood said the bank expected to complete the work by the end of  next year.</p>
<p>- Joe Ortiz, London Newsroom +44 171 542 8864.</p>
</text>
